# AmneziaWG. Not in any photonicat feed and not in ImmortalWrt's either, and
# the prebuilt releases cannot be used here: the 24.10.x .ipk carry a 6.6.144
# kmod against this device's 6.12.91, and the 25.12.x builds are .apk, which
# this firmware's opkg cannot read. Building it in-tree is what gets a module
# whose vermagic matches the running kernel.
src-git awg https://github.com/Slava-Shchipunov/awg-openwrt.git
